    normen: ["§ 11 Abs. 2 BewG", "§ 9 BewG", "§ 9 Abs. 1 ErbStG", "§ 151 Abs. 1 BewG", "§ 13a ErbStG", "§ 13 Abs. 1 ErbStG", "§ 10 Abs. 5 ErbStG", "§ 12 Abs. 2 ErbStG", "§ 199 BewG"],
